{
  "Npc": "pawnbroker",
  "EntryOption": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_entry",
  "EntryOptionZh": "[说两句] 老板，生意不错。",
  "EntryNode": "pawnbroker_intro",
  "Nodes": [
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_intro",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_intro",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：买东西？当东西？还是找门路？\n（老周，玩家）：看你这身土——不像来当东西的。",
      "EnterAction": "PROBE:mark",
      "EnterParam": "met",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_self",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[搭话] 先说说你自己吧。",
          "Once": "ask_self",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "ask_self",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_ask_self"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_sister",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[打听] 三个月前，见过一个穿青布的姑娘吗？",
          "Once": "ask_sister",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark+clue",
          "ActionParam": "ask_sister;sister_1",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_ask_sister"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_gang",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[打听] 守门那个人，怎么才能过去？",
          "Once": "ask_gang",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "ask_gang",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_ask_gang"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_errand",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[零活] 你这铺子里有跑腿打杂的活吗？",
          "Action": "PROBE:errand",
          "ActionParam": "50",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_errand",
          "Requires": "asked:ask_self,asked:ask_gang,errand_ready,!street_help_pending"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_deal",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[求门路] 我手头空，你这儿有什么赚钱的门路？",
          "Requires": "!quest_accepted,!quest_turned,asked:ask_gang",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_deal"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_chat",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[叙旧] 老周，近来摊子上还安生？",
          "Requires": "quest_turned,asked:ask_gang",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_chat"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_money",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[递钱] 这点意思，您收着。",
          "Requires": "clue:sister_3,asked:ask_self,asked:ask_sister,asked:ask_gang",
          "Once": "offer_money",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "offer_money",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_money_covert"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_help_reward",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[酬谢] 刚才替你挡了那一下，咱们也算相识了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_help_reward",
          "Requires": "street_help_pending,asked:ask_self,asked:ask_gang",
          "Action": "PROBE:street_help_reward"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_leave",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[离开]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
