    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_ask_self",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_ask_self",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：我姓周，街坊都叫老周。\n（老周，玩家）：这铺子开了二十三年——后十三年，是给别人开的。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_self_stay",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[追问] 被压榨成这样，你怎么不走？",
          "Once": "self_stay",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "self_stay",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_ask_stay"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_self_know",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[接话] 所以这城门口的事，你都门儿清？",
          "Once": "self_know",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "self_know",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_ask_know"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_ask_stay",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_ask_stay",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：走去哪。我这岁数出了城门，就是路边的死人。\n（老周，玩家）：人啊，不是不想走，是走不动。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_ask_know",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_ask_know",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：城门口的当铺，进出的东西比人还杂。\n（老周，玩家）：谁手头紧、谁刚发横财，翻翻当票就一清二楚。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_ask_sister",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_ask_sister",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：三个月前，青布衣裳，女的。……有了。\n（老周，玩家）：「银镯一只，押三十，赎期三日」。人没来赎。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_sister_where",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[追问] 她当完镯子，往哪去了？",
          "Once": "sister_where",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark+clue",
          "ActionParam": "sister_where;sister_2",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_sister_where"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_sister_redeem",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[赎当] 那只银镯，我替她赎回来。",
          "Requires": "can_redeem_keepsake,!clue:sister_3",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_sister_redeem"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_sister_why",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[追问] 三个月前的当票，你怎么记得这么清？",
          "Once": "sister_why",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "sister_why",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_sister_why"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_negative",
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_sister_where",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_sister_where",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：那天她后头跟着个人。穿水靠，站在门外没进来。\n（老周，玩家）：码头帮的。押完镯子，她就跟人走了。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_sister_why",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_sister_why",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：这行当靠的就是记。记错一笔，摊子就完了。\n（老周，玩家）：你妹妹那只镯子，是我三个月里唯一一只没人来赎的。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_sister_redeem",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_sister_redeem",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：三十第纳尔。\n（老周，玩家）：赎期过了，按规矩该加二成。……算了，就收你三十。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_pay30",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[付钱] 三十第纳尔，数好了。（30 第纳尔）",
          "Requires": "can_redeem_keepsake,!clue:sister_3",
          "Action": "PROBE:redeem_keepsake",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_sister_got"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_hold",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[暂缓] 先替我留着，我凑够钱再来赎。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_closed_negative"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_sister_got",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_sister_got",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：镯子拿好。内侧刻着个「宁」字，没让人碰过。\n（老周，玩家）：这城里丢过的人比丢过的钱多。往码头找，别一个人去。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_hub"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_leave",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[离开]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_ask_gang",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_ask_gang",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：守门那个叫铁头。贪，见钱就抬眼皮。\n（老周，玩家）：但他不怕横的——你亮刀子，他真敢捅你。给钱，或者……",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_gang_how",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[追问] 或者怎么样？",
          "Once": "gang_how",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark+clue",
          "ActionParam": "gang_how;gate_disguise",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_ask_gang_2"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_gang_price",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[问价] 打点他要多少第纳尔？",
          "Once": "gang_price",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark+clue",
          "ActionParam": "gang_price;gate_bribe",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_ask_gang_3"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_closed_very_negative"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_ask_gang_2",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_ask_gang_2",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：……或者，换身有头脸的行头，别让他认出你。\n（老周，玩家）：你这张脸，城门海捕文书上贴着呢。虽然画得糙。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_negative",
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_ask_gang_3",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_ask_gang_3",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：一百第纳尔。这数我心里有。\n（老周，玩家）：少一个子儿，他能在门槛上跟你磨到天黑。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_deal",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_deal",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：码头帮有个收数的，欠我三笔死账，拖了半年。\n（老周，玩家）：把钱给我收回来——不用见血。办妥了我给你酬劳。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_take_job",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[应下] 这活我接了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_quest_accept"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_deal_why",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[反问] 收账这事，你怎么不自己去？",
          "Once": "deal_why",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "deal_why",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_deal_why"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_refuse",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[缓一缓] 我只想找人，暂时不想惹码头帮。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_deal_refuse"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_closed_very_negative"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_deal_why",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_deal_why",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：我去？我这把老骨头，去了就是躺着回来。\n（老周，玩家）：我这辈子只跟算盘打交道。拳脚的事，我不碰。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_take_job",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[应下] 这活我接了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_quest_accept"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_deal_refuse",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_deal_refuse",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：也对。那伙人，惹上一个躺一个。\n（老周，玩家）：不过我把话撂这儿——你要找的姑娘，也是他们带走的。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_quest_accept",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_quest_accept",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：那收数人每天午后在西边巷口蹲着。\n（老周，玩家）：一百二十第纳尔，一分不能少。别闹出人命。",
      "EnterAction": "PROBE:accept_quest",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_hub"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_leave",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[离开]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "pawnbroker_turnin",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_turnin",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（玩家，老周）：一百二十第纳尔，原数追回来了。\n（老周，玩家）：……真让你从他嘴里撬出来了。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_pawnbroker_opt_turnin_ok",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[交差] 一百二十第纳尔都在这儿，没闹出人命。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "pawnbroker_turnin_ok",
          "Requires": "!resolution:force"
